  {
    "name": "brunella-self-improve",
    "transport": "stdio",
    "command": "node",
    "args": [
      "-e",
      "const { execSync } = require('child_process'); try { const r = execSync('npx brunella conductor health --json', { encoding: 'utf8' }); console.log(JSON.stringify({ type: 'health-report', data: JSON.parse(r) })); } catch(e) { console.log(JSON.stringify({ type: 'error', message: e.message })); }"
    ],
    "description": "Brunella \u00f6nfejleszt\u0151 MCP bel\u00e9p\u00e9si pont \u2014 conductor health elemz\u00e9s, Copilot CLI Plan \u00e1gensnek adja \u00e1t az eredm\u00e9nyt. \u00dctemez\u00e9s: .github/workflows/self-improve.yml (napi 09:00 UTC). On-demand: npx brunella conductor health --json | gh copilot 'Analyze and create improvement tasks'",
